{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油麻地新填地街316至320號永福大廈一個住宅單位，今日（11日）早上7時10分發生火警，據報有充電器短路冒煙。消防員接報到場開動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，火警於29分鐘後救熄，14男11女自行疏散，最少5人不適，包括一名男嬰，當中起火單位的男住戶送院進一步治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"新填地街一個單位疑電腦火牛冒煙起火。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197095201147981824984061.jpeg/wG6fe_5W-KjuLCPN5HKUOw-mYawhtXJsmfMgcpnzIHI\"/><figcaption>新填地街一個單位疑電腦火牛冒煙起火。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197095718154801152230658.jpeg/wo7rqnypmT_pmmQKEhVXYoEpTwNEJzxTycpf6snKX-o\"/><figcaption>男住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197095715273183232064198.jpeg/rwoO1zkanHWVFYI2fWg8HNoNtGJbJ12ogx89coMfPXI\"/><figcaption>有住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場協助住戶登記。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096783289782272052738.jpeg/nhpyedr-sAmoOFqRuzmL5InwkST_X6TBLgXSXy4F0l8\"/><figcaption>警方在場協助住戶登記。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096786326589440760134.jpeg/f05b6SI_GeX0i0xE51QaIXDN5heoQ8ykDBIISQwSCEk\"/><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場協助住戶登記。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096789275316224476350.jpeg/91iKWvUsSeH8h5XY8DHlDIwUlW4y9TF3xb-0LsW_tC4\"/><figcaption>警方在場協助住戶登記。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名女童獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096792035299328385247.jpeg/zjX3kmPc3kEiww-lIqEDEgquE8hBnzNil33JpZd9yaU\"/><figcaption>一名女童獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名女童獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096794707202048180523.jpeg/IiTn9QQZ42i7GfOMswqca0uP5bYw9UjWktm9WJLZvVg\"/><figcaption>一名女童獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"住戶帶同寵物走火警。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096782304120832231654.jpeg/OuWCdgcl316uK3XOhOVhmnWtHRkDMuEFYt3Id2LdyHc\"/><figcaption>住戶帶同寵物走火警。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女童受驚落淚，獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096784900526080128974.jpeg/0S_m6ncWBrwA553Tbqxgupd281RoYEthk80V5pPNFeY\"/><figcaption>女童受驚落淚，獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名女童獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096787660509184761325.jpeg/Mfc_fhOstAe8C3eE2dq9YvLakZSb_FDCmuwEo5rsBKM\"/><figcaption>一名女童獲警員給外套保暖。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096790445658112372895.jpeg/M7dF4VBTU7zzX9ntz4lbfn32hxaZA0UBygF4e8oBeHs\"/><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多名住戶疏散落樓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096792941400064754062.jpeg/AFkZmkaB5UTX-BuQmoodCIUeXkLG4JooQH7TCUB-0wk\"/><figcaption>多名住戶疏散落樓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新填地街一個單位有充電器冒煙。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096775320604672451037.jpeg/PsPFkrUua8FiaK4Jh941cG2mjdNcbap8VNBGmlTQRpo\"/><figcaption>新填地街一個單位有充電器冒煙。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場所見，大廈搭有棚架及圍網，消防員向單位射水灌救。最少5名住戶登上救護車接受檢查及治理。</p><p>警方經調查後稱，電腦的充電器冒煙起火，24歲男住戶發現報警及逃生，他其後送廣華醫院治理；其餘人經檢查後毋須送院。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197089642327838720851742.jpeg/5JouYOqF5MF-lb7Tyw7z_Xt5Ok7lEDKGjx_8JI8f_CQ\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水。</figcaption></figure><p>根據[香港機電工程署（EMSD）發布的充電器安全須知，俗稱「火牛」的電源適配器及外置充電裝置，在長期連接電源且處於高負載待機狀態時，內部變壓線圈與電容極易因散熱不良出現老化衰退。若遇上零件品質不佳或電路保護機制不足，容易導致擊穿短路並引燃塑料外殼。</p><p>當局呼籲市民，使用充電裝置時必須置於視線範圍內，切勿長期不拔電源插頭，一旦發現設備異常發燙、發出微噪或異味，必須立刻拔掉電源並停用。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:51:00.325562+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":708,"images":15,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:51.986891+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T02:44:37.561215+00:00","content_hash":"2a2f2ab999ff5cf70b295795a249e5a6fe0c05efe5fab3c9fb3b83f9884f5a71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}